                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is beyond awful.  What you see int he video is what you will do for the first 35 game days until you finally start generating enough money to sustain yourself.  Then you'll start saving for upgrades.  But if you buy any upgrade that increases the rate you gain EXP, it breaks it.  A number of things don't work.  There is NO sound in the game.\n\nI figured I'd check it out since I play so many incremental games and stuff but after I get my refund, I honestly wouldn't pay $0.05 for this game.  Sorry Dev.  Not sure how you got this onto steam but it doesn't belong here yet.  Hopefully in the future you'll improve the UI, get some sounds, fix the game breaking bugs and broken features.\n\n0.1/10",
